    "detailed_description": "Embark on an exhilarating journey into the heart of aerial warfare with <strong>Splash One</strong>, a military flight simulator that strikes the perfect balance between realism and accessibility. Experience the thrill of piloting cutting-edge fighter jets in high-stakes dogfights above the clouds. Whether you're a seasoned pilot or a newcomer to the skies, Splash One offers an engaging and immersive experience without the need for a Ph.D. in aviation.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Some of the features include:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Aircraft destruction<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2758400/extras/0dec69da6ea6b58b17ecace436e8e5a0.poster.avif?t=1724755294\" width=690 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2758400/extras/0dec69da6ea6b58b17ecace436e8e5a0.webm?t=1724755294\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2758400/extras/0dec69da6ea6b58b17ecace436e8e5a0.mp4?t=1724755294\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br></li><li>Realistic flight physics (lift, thrust, drag, and weight that is affected by the aircraft's fuel and payload)<br></li><li>Customizable loadouts<br></li><li>Radar<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2758400/extras/b9c18c7224666f43980e4bef68241a80.poster.avif?t=1724755294\" width=518 height=518 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2758400/extras/b9c18c7224666f43980e4bef68241a80.webm?t=1724755294\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2758400/extras/b9c18c7224666f43980e4bef68241a80.mp4?t=1724755294\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br></li><li>Guns<br></li><li>Unguided, Laser and GPS guided bombs<br></li><li>Semi-active radar homing missile<br></li><li>Infrared homing missile<br></li><li>Active radar homing missile<br></li><li>Ejection seat</li></ul>",
